Package: CPIAggr
Title: CPI Custom Aggregate Calculator
Version: 1.0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Gerry", "O\'Donnell", email = "gerry.odonnell@statcan.gc.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R Shiny app which opens a browser to allow users to select published CPI products and geographies and calculate Custom CPIs as aggregates of selected series or as All-items excluding the selections.
